OL,3,AGaten Matarazzo on life after Stranger
OL,4,AThings as he makes West End debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FKeeping your balance on a revolving
OL,7,Fstage probably sounds easy when you
OL,8,Fcompare it with battling demogorgons,
OL,9,Fbut Gaten Matarazzo points out one big
OL,10,Fdifference.
OL,12,FYou don't get the luxury of "thirty
OL,13,Ftakes" to get it right in front of a
OL,14,Flive audience.
OL,16,FThe former Stranger Things star's
OL,17,Fcurrently playing Mark in a modern
OL,18,Frevival of rock musical Rent on
OL,19,FLondon's West End.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
