OL,3,AGaten Matarazzo on life after Stranger
OL,4,AThings as he makes West End debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe tells BBC Newsbeat that having a
OL,7,Fproper schedule and remembering to stay
OL,8,Fhydrated makes a "refreshing change"
OL,9,Ffrom filming the Netflix smash-hit that
OL,10,Fmade him famous.
